# Target paths chezmoi should delete from $HOME on every apply.
#
# chezmoi does NOT remove a file from the target just because it disappeared from
# the source, so retired entries have to be listed here explicitly.

# Retired: the Brave desktop entry used to launch the flatpak (com.brave.Browser).
# Both browsers are now native AUR packages, and the entries that replace this one
# are brave-origin.desktop and chromium.desktop, which override the system files of
# the same name. Without this line, a machine provisioned before the switch keeps a
# stale launcher pointing at a flatpak that is no longer installed.
.local/share/applications/com.brave.Browser.desktop
